WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:08.900
Meet webfaCe Desk. One assistant that minds your business, on a computer of its own, all day and all night.

2
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:17.500
It's signed in to your email, so it starts the morning the way you would. What came in, and what do they want.

3
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:38.800
It writes the reply in your voice. It doesn't send it. It shows you first.

4
00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:59.500
Your calendar's connected too. Holding time, booking, confirming. It asks before anything is real.

5
00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:20.500
Quotes come from your own price list. It never invents a number.

6
00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:41.600
You tell it about your business once. You sign in to your tools once. That's the setup.

7
00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:52.100
webfaCe Desk. Minding your business, 24/7. webfacedesk.app
